  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of the 1970 Convention and the 2015 Recommendation reinforced</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This workplan includes all activities related to the implementation of the 1970 Convention, the 2015 Recommendation on museums and the work of the ICPRCP. UNESCO will support Member States with guidance for the implementation of the 1970 Convention through advocacy, policy and technical advice, awareness-raising, reinforcing institutional, operational and legal capacities, as well as promoting international cooperation, partnerships with museums and synergies with the 2001 Convention. UNESCO will promote the protection and promotion of museums and collections through the implementation of the 2015 Recommendation. UNESCO will continue its leadership in the preservation of movable cultural property with a special focus on Africa, SIDS and countries affected by armed conflict or natural disasters.</narrative>
  </description>
